# Component-level connections (wires)
MainGenerator-->PowerSensor@power
PowerSensor-->MainController@data
MainController-->MainGenerator@control
TankSensor-->MainController@data
MainController-->MainPump@control
MainPump-->WaterTank@water

# Station-level connections (roads)
StationA<-->StationB@road

# Block-level connections (hallways)
BlockA1<-->BlockA2@hallway
BlockB1<-->BlockB2@hallway
